div.p:
Recalling that the essential objective of the
Resolutions of the General Assembly referred to was the establishment of a
unified, independent and democratic Government in Korea;

list.item:
elections be held and other constituent acts be taken under the auspices
                        of the United Nations for the establishment of a unified, independent, and
                        democratic Government in a sovereign state of Korea;

div.p:
Mindful of the fact that at the end of the present
hostilities the task of rehabilitating the Korean economy will be of great
magnitude;
